      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Although pain is a common symptom in HIV-positive and AIDS patients, in particular the chronic variety is frequently not adequately treated in this population. The present review article identifies possible reasons for this situation, summarizes the most common causes of chronic pain, and draws attention to the therapeutic problems specific to these particular groups."},
